---
interface Props { data?: any }
const { data } = Astro.props;
---
<div class="mockup-pregnancy-week" set:html={`<section class="hero"><div class="wrap"><div class="crumb"><b>Pregnancy</b> / Pregnancy week calculator</div><div class="grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Pregnancy calculator</div><h1>Your pregnancy, week by week.</h1><p class="lead">Find your gestational age, trimester, estimated due date and the milestones coming next.</p><div class="chips"><span>✓ Naegele’s rule</span><span>♡ Obstetric dating</span><span>🔒 Your dates stay private</span></div><article class="week-card"><div class="week-top"><b>Your pregnancy today</b><span id="hero-trim">Second trimester</span></div><div class="week-main"><strong id="hero-week">24 weeks, 2 days</strong><small id="hero-left">110 days to go</small></div><div class="mini-track"><i id="mini-progress"></i></div><div class="mini-labels"><span>Week 1</span><span>Week 20</span><span>Week 40</span></div></article></div>
<form class="calc" onsubmit="return false"><div class="calc-head"><div><h2>Calculate your week</h2><p>Choose the information you know best.</p></div><span class="tag">Estimate</span></div><div class="label">Calculate from</div><div class="methods"><button class="method active" data-method="lmp"><i>▣</i>Last period</button><button class="method" data-method="conception"><i>♡</i>Conception date</button><button class="method" data-method="ultrasound"><i></i>Ultrasound</button><button class="method" data-method="due"><i>◎</i>Due date</button></div><div class="label">Your dates</div><div class="fields"><div class="field wide" id="main-date-field"><label id="main-label">First day of your last period</label><input id="main-date" type="date" value="2026-02-09"></div><div class="field"><label>Calculate as of</label><input id="today" type="date" value="2026-07-29"></div><div class="field" id="cycle-field"><label>Usual cycle length</label><select id="cycle"><option>26</option><option selected>28</option><option>30</option><option>32</option><option>35</option></select></div><div class="field hide" id="scan-week-field"><label>Gestational week at scan</label><select id="scan-week"><option value="8">8 weeks</option><option value="10">10 weeks</option><option value="12" selected>12 weeks</option><option value="14">14 weeks</option><option value="20">20 weeks</option></select></div></div><div class="privacy">✓ We don’t store or send any date you enter.</div><section class="result"><div class="result-top"><div><small id="result-label">ESTIMATED GESTATIONAL AGE</small><div class="weeks" id="weeks">24 weeks · 2 days</div></div><div class="due"><small>Estimated due date</small><b id="due-date">November 16, 2026</b></div></div><div class="stats"><span>TRIMESTER<b id="trimester">Second</b></span><span>APPROX. MONTH<b id="month">Month 6</b></span><span>DAYS TO DUE DATE<b id="days-left">110 days</b></span></div><button class="go" id="update">Update pregnancy</button></section></form></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap"><header class="center"><span>The full journey</span><h2>Where you are within the 40 weeks</h2><p>Trimesters are useful reference points for growth and appointments, although every pregnancy follows its own timeline.</p></header><div class="track"><i class="marker" id="marker" data-label="Week 24"></i></div><div class="trimesters"><article class="trim"><small>WEEK 1 TO 13+6</small><b>First trimester</b><p>Early development, initial appointments and dating.</p></article><article class="trim active"><small>WEEK 14 TO 27+6</small><b>Second trimester</b><p>Movement, anatomy scan and steady growth.</p></article><article class="trim"><small>FROM WEEK 28</small><b>Third trimester</b><p>Maturation, weight gain and birth preparation.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section tint"><div class="wrap week-grid"><article class="card baby"><div class="fruit" id="fruit">🌽</div><div><span id="baby-week">Baby at week 24</span><h2 id="baby-size">About the size of an ear of corn</h2><div class="metrics"><div class="metric"><small>Length</small><b id="length">30 cm</b></div><div class="metric"><small>Weight</small><b id="weight">600 g</b></div></div></div></article><article class="card milestones"><span>What may be happening now</span><h3>Growth continues every day</h3><div class="milestone"><i>👂</i><div><b>Hearing is developing</b><p>Your baby may respond to familiar voices and sounds.</p></div></div><div class="milestone"><i>🫁</i><div><b>Lungs continue to mature</b><p>Important structures for breathing keep developing.</p></div></div><div class="milestone"><i>〰</i><div><b>Movement patterns</b><p>You may notice more distinct periods of activity.</p></div></div></article></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="wrap dates-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow">Dates to keep handy</div><h2>Your next pregnancy milestones.</h2><p>These are general calendar references. Your care team will personalize appointments based on your health and pregnancy.</p></div><div class="dates"><article class="date"><small>THIRD TRIMESTER</small><b id="third-date">August 24, 2026</b><span>Week 28</span></article><article class="date"><small>FULL TERM BEGINS</small><b id="term-date">October 26, 2026</b><span>Week 37</span></article><article class="date primary"><small>ESTIMATED DUE DATE</small><b id="due-date-2">November 16, 2026</b><span>Week 40</span></article></div></div></section>
<section class="notice"><div class="wrap notice-grid"><div><div class="eyebrow" style="color:#ccbaff">A guide, not a diagnosis</div><h2>An early ultrasound may adjust your dates.</h2><p>If your cycles are irregular or your last period is uncertain, first-trimester ultrasound dating is often more reliable. Always confirm timing with your prenatal care professional.</p></div><div class="facts"><div class="fact"><small>EARLY ULTRASOUND</small><b>8–12 weeks</b><span>Dating reference</span></div><div class="fact"><small>STANDARD LENGTH</small><b>40 weeks</b><span>From the LMP</span></div><div class="fact"><small>BORN ON DUE DATE</small><b>About 4%</b><span>It is only an estimate</span></div></div></div></section>`} />
<script is:inline>
(()=>{const root=document.currentScript.previousElementSibling?.matches('.mockup-pregnancy-week')?document.currentScript.previousElementSibling:document.querySelector('.mockup-pregnancy-week');

const $=s=>root.querySelector(s),$$=s=>[...root.querySelectorAll(s)],DAY=864e5;let method="lmp";function read(v){const[y,m,d]=v.split("-").map(Number);return new Date(y,m-1,d,12)}function add(d,n){return new Date(d.getTime()+n*DAY)}function fmt(d){return new Intl.DateTimeFormat("en-US",{month:"long",day:"numeric",year:"numeric"}).format(d)}
const sizes=[{w:4,e:"🌱",n:"a poppy seed",l:".2 cm",g:"<1 g"},{w:8,e:"🫐",n:"a blueberry",l:"1.6 cm",g:"1 g"},{w:12,e:"🍋",n:"a lime",l:"5.4 cm",g:"14 g"},{w:16,e:"🥑",n:"an avocado",l:"11.6 cm",g:"100 g"},{w:20,e:"🍌",n:"a banana",l:"25 cm",g:"320 g"},{w:24,e:"🌽",n:"an ear of corn",l:"30 cm",g:"600 g"},{w:28,e:"🍆",n:"an eggplant",l:"37.6 cm",g:"1 kg"},{w:32,e:"🥥",n:"a coconut",l:"42 cm",g:"1.7 kg"},{w:36,e:"🥬",n:"a head of romaine",l:"47 cm",g:"2.6 kg"},{w:40,e:"🎃",n:"a small pumpkin",l:"51 cm",g:"3.4 kg"}];
function calc(){const main=read($("#main-date").value),today=read($("#today").value),cycle=Number($("#cycle").value)||28;let lmp;if(method==="lmp")lmp=add(main,cycle-28);else if(method==="conception")lmp=add(main,-14);else if(method==="due")lmp=add(main,-280);else lmp=add(main,-Number($("#scan-week").value)*7);let elapsed=Math.max(0,Math.min(300,Math.round((today-lmp)/DAY))),w=Math.floor(elapsed/7),d=elapsed%7,due=add(lmp,280),left=Math.max(0,Math.ceil((due-today)/DAY)),trim=w<14?"First":w<28?"Second":"Third",month=Math.max(1,Math.min(10,Math.floor(elapsed/30.44)+1)),size=sizes.reduce((a,x)=>w>=x.w?x:a,sizes[0]);$("#weeks").textContent=`${w} weeks · ${d} ${d===1?"day":"days"}`;$("#due-date").textContent=fmt(due);$("#due-date-2").textContent=fmt(due);$("#third-date").textContent=fmt(add(lmp,196));$("#term-date").textContent=fmt(add(lmp,259));$("#trimester").textContent=trim;$("#month").textContent=`Month ${month}`;$("#days-left").textContent=`${left} days`;$("#hero-week").textContent=`${w} weeks, ${d} ${d===1?"day":"days"}`;$("#hero-left").textContent=`${left} days to go`;$("#hero-trim").textContent=`${trim} trimester`;$("#mini-progress").style.width=Math.min(100,elapsed/280*100)+"%";$("#marker").style.left=Math.min(100,elapsed/280*100)+"%";$("#marker").dataset.label=`Week ${w}`;$$(".trim").forEach((x,i)=>x.classList.toggle("active",i===(w<14?0:w<28?1:2)));$("#fruit").textContent=size.e;$("#baby-week").textContent=`Baby at week ${w}`;$("#baby-size").textContent=`About the size of ${size.n}`;$("#length").textContent=size.l;$("#weight").textContent=size.g}
function setMethod(m){method=m;$$(".method").forEach(b=>b.classList.toggle("active",b.dataset.method===m));$("#scan-week-field").classList.toggle("hide",m!=="ultrasound");$("#cycle-field").classList.toggle("hide",m!=="lmp");$("#main-label").textContent=m==="lmp"?"First day of your last period":m==="conception"?"Estimated conception date":m==="ultrasound"?"Ultrasound date":"Estimated due date";$("#result-label").textContent=m==="ultrasound"?"GESTATIONAL AGE FROM ULTRASOUND":m==="due"?"GESTATIONAL AGE FROM DUE DATE":"ESTIMATED GESTATIONAL AGE";calc()}$$(".method").forEach(b=>b.onclick=()=>setMethod(b.dataset.method));$$("input,select").forEach(i=>i.oninput=calc);$("#update").onclick=e=>{calc();e.currentTarget.textContent="✓ Pregnancy updated";setTimeout(()=>e.currentTarget.textContent="Update pregnancy",1200)};setMethod("lmp");

})();
</script>
<style is:global>

.mockup-pregnancy-week{--ink:#1d2440;--muted:#6e7083;--line:#e3dfe9;--purple:#8060c2;--pink:#d77b91;--lav:#f0ebff;--blush:#fdecef;--navy:#29324e;--wash:#faf7ff}.mockup-pregnancy-week *{box-sizing:border-box}.mockup-pregnancy-week{margin:0;font-family:Inter,ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,sans-serif;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-pregnancy-week button,.mockup-pregnancy-week input,.mockup-pregnancy-week select{font:inherit}.mockup-pregnancy-week .wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px));margin:auto}.mockup-pregnancy-week .top{height:80px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .nav,.mockup-pregnancy-week .brand,.mockup-pregnancy-week .links,.mockup-pregnancy-week .tools{display:flex;align-items:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .nav{height:100%;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-pregnancy-week .brand{gap:10px;font-size:18px;font-weight:900}.mockup-pregnancy-week .logo{width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:11px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .links{gap:27px;color:#596176;font-size:12px;font-weight:750}.mockup-pregnancy-week .tools{gap:10px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .tool{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:10px 14px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.mockup-pregnancy-week .dark{background:var(--navy);color:#fff}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .hero{padding:30px 0 72px;background:radial-gradient(circle at 10% 30%,#efe8ff 0,transparent 29%),radial-gradient(circle at 90% 5%,#ffe9e7 0,transparent 30%),linear-gradient(180deg,#fff,#faf8ff)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .crumb{font-size:12px;color:#7e7e90;margin-bottom:34px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .crumb b{color:var(--purple)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.88fr 1.12fr;gap:54px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .eyebrow{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;color:var(--purple);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.16em;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;margin:8px 0 18px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .eyebrow:before{content:"";width:28px;height:2px;background:var(--purple)}.mockup-pregnancy-week h1{font-size:54px;line-height:.99;letter-spacing:-.055em;margin:0 0 21px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .lead{font-size:18px;line-height:1.58;color:var(--muted)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .chips{display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:25px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .chips span{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:99px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:10px;color:#636477}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-card{margin-top:34px;max-width:455px;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:19px;padding:20px;box-shadow:0 18px 45px #47385810}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-top b{font-size:14px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-top span{background:var(--blush);color:#9a5263;border-radius:99px;padding:6px 9px;font-size:9px;font-weight:850}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-main{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;margin:20px 0 14px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-main strong{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.045em}.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-main small{color:var(--muted)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .mini-track{height:8px;background:#eeeaf4;border-radius:99px;overflow:hidden}.mockup-pregnancy-week .mini-track i{display:block;width:60.5%;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--purple),var(--pink))}.mockup-pregnancy-week .mini-labels{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9px;color:#8b8997;margin-top:7px}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .calc{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:23px;padding:27px;box-shadow:0 24px 60px #47385817}.mockup-pregnancy-week .calc-head{display:flex;justify-content:space-between}.mockup-pregnancy-week .calc h2{font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .calc-head p{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:5px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .tag{background:var(--lav);color:var(--purple);border-radius:99px;padding:7px 10px;height:max-content;font-size:10px;font-weight:850}.mockup-pregnancy-week .label{font-size:10px;font-weight:900;margin:20px 0 8px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .methods{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:7px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .method{border:1px solid var(--line);background:#fff;border-radius:11px;padding:9px 4px;min-height:64px;color:#606174;font-size:8px;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.mockup-pregnancy-week .method i{display:block;font-style:normal;font-size:18px;margin-bottom:4px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .method.active{border:2px solid var(--purple);background:#f5f1ff;color:#684ba5;padding:8px 3px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fields{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:9px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .field{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:11px;padding:9px 11px;min-height:58px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .field.wide{grid-column:1/-1}.mockup-pregnancy-week .field.hide{display:none}.mockup-pregnancy-week .field label{display:block;color:#707183;font-size:8px;margin-bottom:5px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .field input,.mockup-pregnancy-week .field select{width:100%;border:0;outline:0;background:transparent;color:var(--ink);font-weight:800}.mockup-pregnancy-week .privacy{font-size:9px;color:#777789;margin:11px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .result{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:19px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .result-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:13px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .result small{color:#cbd0df;font-size:9px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .weeks{font-size:33px;letter-spacing:-.045em;font-weight:900;margin-top:5px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .due{background:var(--blush);color:#914e61;border-radius:10px;padding:9px 11px;text-align:right}.mockup-pregnancy-week .due small{color:inherit}.mockup-pregnancy-week .due b{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:2px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:8px;border-top:1px solid #ffffff26;margin-top:14px;padding-top:13px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .stats span{font-size:8px;color:#c4cad7}.mockup-pregnancy-week .stats b{display:block;color:#fff;font-size:11px;margin-top:4px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .go{width:100%;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--purple),var(--pink));color:#fff;padding:12px;margin-top:14px;font-weight:900;cursor:pointer}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .section{padding:74px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .section.tint{background:var(--wash)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .center{text-align:center;max-width:700px;margin:0 auto 38px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .center span{font-size:10px;color:var(--purple);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;font-weight:900}.mockup-pregnancy-week .center h2{font-size:38px;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:10px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .center p{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6}.mockup-pregnancy-week .track{height:18px;border-radius:99px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#ece5ff 0 35%,#fbe6ec 35% 70%,#e5f4ef 70%);position:relative;margin:64px 25px 24px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .marker{position:absolute;left:60.5%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:34px;height:34px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--purple);border:6px solid #fff;box-shadow:0 7px 16px #65469d42}.mockup-pregnancy-week .marker:before{content:attr(data-label);position:absolute;bottom:35px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);white-space:nowrap;background:var(--navy);color:#fff;border-radius:7px;padding:7px 9px;font-size:9px;font-weight:850}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trimesters{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trim{border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;padding:18px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trim.active{border:2px solid var(--pink);background:#fff9fa}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trim small{font-size:8px;color:#81808e}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trim b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin:6px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .trim p{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.5;margin:0}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.9fr 1.1fr;gap:20px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .card{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:18px;padding:25px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .baby{display:grid;grid-template-columns:110px 1fr;gap:20px;align-items:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fruit{width:108px;height:108px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--lav);display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:51px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .card>span,.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestones>span{font-size:9px;color:var(--purple);letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;font-weight:900}.mockup-pregnancy-week .baby h2{font-size:27px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:8px 0 12px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .metrics{display:flex;gap:8px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .metric{background:#f7f5fa;border-radius:9px;padding:9px 11px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .metric small{font-size:8px;color:#747485;display:block}.mockup-pregnancy-week .metric b{font-size:12px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestones h3{font-size:20px;margin:7px 0 14px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestone{display:flex;gap:11px;margin:13px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestone i{font-style:normal;width:33px;height:33px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--blush);display:grid;place-items:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestone b{font-size:10px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .milestone p{font-size:9px;color:var(--muted);margin:3px 0;line-height:1.45}
.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates-grid h2{font-size:36px;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:10px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates-grid p{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.6}.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:17px;padding:21px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .date{background:#f8f6fb;border-radius:11px;padding:15px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .date.primary{background:var(--lav);color:#62459f}.mockup-pregnancy-week .date small{font-size:8px;color:#777789}.mockup-pregnancy-week .date b{display:block;font-size:15px;margin:7px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .date span{font-size:8px;color:#747485}.mockup-pregnancy-week .notice{background:var(--navy);color:#fff;padding:63px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .notice-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:45px;align-items:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .notice h2{font-size:34px;letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:9px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .notice p{color:#cbd0df;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6}.mockup-pregnancy-week .facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:9px;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:20px;color:var(--ink)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fact{text-align:center;background:#f7f5fa;border-radius:10px;padding:14px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fact small{font-size:8px;color:#737486}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fact b{display:block;font-size:16px;margin:7px 0}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fact span{font-size:8px;color:#777789}
@media(max-width:850px){.mockup-pregnancy-week .links{display:none}.mockup-pregnancy-week .grid,.mockup-pregnancy-week .week-grid,.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates-grid,.mockup-pregnancy-week .notice-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-pregnancy-week h1{font-size:44px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .methods{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}@media(max-width:520px){.mockup-pregnancy-week .wrap{width:calc(100% - 24px)}.mockup-pregnancy-week .tools .tool:first-child{display:none}.mockup-pregnancy-week h1{font-size:38px}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fields,.mockup-pregnancy-week .stats,.mockup-pregnancy-week .trimesters,.mockup-pregnancy-week .dates,.mockup-pregnancy-week .facts{grid-template-columns:1fr}.mockup-pregnancy-week .baby{grid-template-columns:1fr;text-align:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .fruit{margin:auto}.mockup-pregnancy-week .metrics{justify-content:center}.mockup-pregnancy-week .section{padding:55px 0}}

.mockup-pregnancy-week { width:100%; overflow:hidden; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .top, .mockup-pregnancy-week header.top { display:none !important; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .foot { display:none !important; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real { width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 40px)); margin:auto; padding:64px 0; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1.2fr .8fr; gap:30px; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real details { border-bottom:1px solid #dfe6ed; padding:14px 0; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real summary { cursor:pointer; font-weight:750; }
.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real p { color:#687a8f; line-height:1.65; }
@media(max-width:800px){.mockup-pregnancy-week .support-real-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
{data && <section class="mockup-pregnancy-week support-real"><div class="support-real-grid"><div><h2>Preguntas frecuentes</h2>{data.faq?.map((f:any,i:number)=><details open={i===0}><summary>{f.q}</summary><p set:html={f.a}/></details>)}</div><div><h2>Fuentes</h2>{data.sources?.map((s:any)=><a href={s.url} target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener">{s.name}</a>)}</div></div></section>}
